            "Cue Scrubber: The Flirt Radar",
            "Scan the Friday-night singles event and ring every move in the courtship sequence: the tossed hair and swaying hips, the eye contact held just long enough, the coy look away. Judge each gesture against the mammalian approach-withdrawal template and the dopamine reward circuit it triggers, and flag the moment the wide net of broadcasting gives way to the Talk.",
